              "engine/cmd/review.go: bind and record now return the stdout write error from writeReviewJSON and exit 1 with a message naming the worktree or stored result. Success exits 0 only after a successful write. engine/cmd/review_test.go covers both paths with a failing stdout, asserting exit code, exact stderr, empty stdout, and that the worktree or stored file still exists.",
